{'symbol': 'CTRA', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'EAGLE SPECIALTY MATERIALS, LLC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF BELLE AYE AND EAGLE BUTTE MINES FROM CONTURA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE:CTRA)', 'text': 'EAGLE SPECIALTY MATERIALS, LLC ENTERED INTO A BINDING TERM SHEET TO ACQUIRE BELLE AYE AND EAGLE BUTTE MINES FROM CONTURA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE:CTRA) ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2019. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO SUBMISSION BY ESM TO THE DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE, APPROVAL BY THE UNITED STATES BANKRUPTCY COURT AND APPROVAL BY THE CONTURA BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND OTHER THIRD PARTY APPROVALS. AS OF OCTOBER 2, 2019, BANKRUPTCY COURT HAS APPROVED THE TRANSACTION\nEAGLE SPECIALTY MATERIALS, LLC COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF BELLE AYE AND EAGLE BUTTE MINES FROM CONTURA ENERGY, INC. (NYSE:CTRA) OCTOBER 18, 2019.\n'}